# Files whose bytes a hash is computed from, or that are applied byte for byte
# (card S02). core.autocrlf=true would otherwise check them out with CRLF on
# Windows: a CSP hash taken from that copy matches nothing a browser sees, and a
# pnpm patch would write CR into the patched files on one OS and not another.
# Only these paths: every other file keeps the checkout's own line endings.
Auth_UI/apps/console/public/email-preview.html text eol=lf
Auth_UI/apps/*/login-design-frame.html text eol=lf
Auth_UI/apps/*/csp/** text eol=lf
Auth_UI/patches/*.patch text eol=lf
